- B | go for the chair openly against {rival}, and win the committee over first | v: power, achievement | title: steward of the land | mark: made an enemy | tribal: put yourself forward against {rival} of the other hearth, and win the elders over first | magic: put your name forward against {rival}, and win the circle's elders over first | chance: 30
