- UR | refuse the chair in writing until the council hands over the low meadow's lease | v: universalism, self-direction | mark: defied an authority | closed: approval: the chair refused on conditions; backfire: the members give the chair to someone else, and the council remembers the letter | tribal: refuse the grove until the elders give the wet meadow back to its keeping | magic: refuse the chair until the lord gives the low meadow back to the grove | chance: 82
