- U | publish the twenty years of counts, so any trust can do the same | v: achievement, universalism | title: keeper of the land | grants: known across the country | habit | tribal: teach the twenty winters of counting to every band's keeper who comes | magic: set down the grove's book of springs for every grove of the realm | chance: 6
- B | let the programme follow the trust for a year, with your name on the work | v: power, achievement | title: keeper of the land | grants: known across the country | identity | tribal: let the traders carry your name from camp to camp, with the grove's story | magic: let the royal clerk set your name to the grove's way in the crown's book | chance: 6
- R | say yes to every school and every coach, and lead the walks yourself | v: benevolence, stimulation | title: keeper of the land | grants: known across the country | self_control: - | tribal: say yes to every band that comes, and walk them round the grounds yourself | magic: say yes to every grove that sends, and walk them round the woods yourself | chance: 6
