works: The stream runs clear again within the month, and the matter is settled the way {N} chose.
works: By the next spring the fish are back in the pool by the bridge, and {N} can look {friend} in the eye.
fails: The stream mends in its own time, but the matter goes badly: questions, a hearing and a cold silence along the valley.
